an ever before, Furuya and Eijun must be determined to pitch with all their skill and strength in order to lead their team to victory. And this time, one of these young pitchers may finally claim that coveted title: \"The Ace of Seidou.\"\n\n(Source: MAL Rewrite)"},"tags":[{"name":"Baseball","rank":93,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Male Cast","rank":85,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Shounen","rank":80,"spoiler":false},{"name":"School","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":73,"spoiler":false},{"name":"School Club","rank":66,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Ensemble Cast","rank":53,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Ace of the Diamond Second Season","english":"Ace of the Diamond Second Season","native":"ダイヤのA～Second Season～","romaji":"Diamond no Ace: Second Season","synonyms":[{"language":"ja","source":"bangumi","value":"ダイヤのA -SECOND SEASON-"},{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"钻石王牌 第二季"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"ダイヤのA セカンドシーズン"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"Ace of Diamond- SECOND SEASON -"}]},"trailer":null,"visibility":"general"}